{"id": "34168", "title": "情人小老师", "author": "爱丽丝", "category": "文学名著", "count": 46, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34168/34168s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34168.htm", "intro": "可恶！都是他的破烂英文害他不能出国为公司争光，他卯起来准备找间补习班，打算好好恶补一番。咦？这个声音甜美的柜台小姐真是正点到不行，他不由自主的掏出钱包，傻愣愣的报了名。没想到她说他程度太差，建议他去吉的堡比较好。门都没有！他才不要放弃可以天天见到她的机会，干脆小人的使出苦肉计加上悲情计。让她在愧疚和同情之下，自愿当他的英文小老师。嘿嘿，可以学好英文又能接近佳人，可说是一举两得，不过要想进一步抱得美人归，还真是令他伤透脑筋。她总是认为自己是不祥的人，只会给他带来厄运。加上暗恋他的“第三者”来搅局，更让她误会连连…", "base": "files/article/html/34/34168", "chapters": [{"title": "序&楔子", "file": "2171942.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2171943.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2171944.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2171945.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2171946.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2171947.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2171948.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2171949.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2171950.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2171951.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2171952.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2171953.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2171954.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2171955.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2171956.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2171957.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2171958.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2171959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2171960.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2171961.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2171962.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2171963.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2171964.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "fil